{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_5","type":"agent_message","text":"I found three causes: project detail reads skip membership checks, list cache keys omit the organization, and updates don’t invalidate cached lists. I’ll add regression tests for those paths, including revoked membership and organization IDs with shared prefixes or punctuation."}}
